# Claude Code worktree/scheduler scratch state -- never part of a real commit.
# Also matters for local act runs: act's checkout copies the working
# directory into the job container respecting .gitignore (--use-gitignore),
# and this directory had grown to 22G (stale worktree incl. a vendored
# submodule's LFS objects) before being added here, filling the Colima VM
# disk on the very first real act job run.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# act (local GitHub Actions parity) — see .secrets.example
.secrets
.act-artifacts/
.act-events/
